                                "sense_id": "10aec2a1-3642-3a19-bc29-aa665ba1c306",
                                "text": "... a cold blashy rain is driven from the spongy west by a wind that would certainly blow you away, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e81feca4-5d91-4c88-aa0c-956f2f3d6ec1",
                                "sense_id": "10aec2a1-3642-3a19-bc29-aa665ba1c306",
                                "text": "\"Mr dowse, what's your opinion o' this blashy weather? Will it blow over, do y' think?\" Dowse pursed his lips and studied the racing clouds. […] \"the wind's still in the sou'-west. Could be it gets worse afore it gets better.\""
                            }
