                                "sense_id": "f5085870-7438-3e46-bc6b-2efc625594c0",
                                "text": "tharrs sa mitch rain o' t' Fog, [...] it maks it blashy as weel, [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4ba14c1a-007f-42c8-a664-7f5e1d4df17b",
                                "sense_id": "f5085870-7438-3e46-bc6b-2efc625594c0",
                                "text": ".[The] road fra Gunnas to Burringham's blashier noo then ever I seed it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8012ea6b-c4d2-4730-bee8-fe45f644ca57",
                                "sense_id": "f5085870-7438-3e46-bc6b-2efc625594c0",
                                "text": "... their streets are like wors - brave and blashy! Song, Canny Nerocassel."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "23db1df3-5f04-4369-b5c4-96c189d5af22",
                                "sense_id": "f5085870-7438-3e46-bc6b-2efc625594c0",
